hymns.bodo_dev:
जेराव गोसोआ गिनाय गैयै, जेराव खर'आ गोजौ;
जेराव ज्ञानआ गासैबो मानसिफोरनो उदां;
जेराव बुहुमखौ गाम-हारिनि सिमा जों बाहागो खालामाखै;
बे उदांनि स्वर्गाव, हे आफा, आंनि हारिया गिखांफिनथों!

hymns.bodo_rom:
Jerao gwswoa ginay gwywi, jerao khwrwa gwojwo;
Jerao jnan-a gasaybw mansiphornw udang;
Jerao buhumkhwo gam-harini sima jwng bahagw khalamakhwi;
Be udangni swrgao, he Afa, angni hariya gikhangfinthwng!

hymns.english:
Where the mind is without fear and the head is held high;
Where knowledge is free;
Where the world has not been broken up into fragments by narrow domestic walls;
Into that heaven of freedom, my Father, let my country awake.
